  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Watershed Management and Enhanced Water Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Improved Irrigation practices in the agricultural sector in Sindh , Outcome 2: Improved water availability communities with a focus on women and children.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project proposal is to implement integrated watershed management solutions for agricultural productivity in the flood-affected areas, while simultaneously enhancing water security at the community level with a special focus on accessibility for women and children.-&#xc18c;&#xaddc;&#xbaa8; &#xb18d;&#xc5c5;&#xc778; &#xd3c9;&#xade0; &#xb18d;&#xc5c5;&#xc0dd;&#xc0b0;&#xc131; &#xc99d;&#xac00;
